# Distribution / packaging
build/
!source/pcv84x6_llm_server/build/
build_soc/
data/
images/
models/
output/*
!.gitkeep
# The `data/` rule above is meant for runtime/build payloads (models, datasets,
# captured device state). It also swallowed the service's CHECKED-IN test
# fixtures under source/pcv84x6_llm_server/tests/data/, so a clean checkout
# could not run `python3 -m pytest -q`: 96 tests failed with FileNotFoundError
# on files the tests legitimately expect. The exception below is deliberately
# narrow -- that one directory and nothing else. No global `data/` is reopened,
# and the fixture set is bounded: every file is a small, reviewable artifact
# whose provenance and digest are recorded in
# source/pcv84x6_llm_server/tests/data/PROVENANCE.md. Anything large or
# licensed (model weights, customer documents) still stays out.
!source/pcv84x6_llm_server/tests/data/
!source/pcv84x6_llm_server/tests/data/**
# psophliteos frontend src 下的 data/(icons.data) images/(logo/header) 是源码资源，需入库
!source/psophliteos/frontend/src/**/data/
!source/psophliteos/frontend/src/**/data/**
!source/psophliteos/frontend/src/assets/images/
!source/psophliteos/frontend/src/assets/images/**
# psewriter docs/images 是 README 的流程图资源，需入库
!source/psewriter/docs/images/
!source/psewriter/docs/images/**
*.user
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.AppImage
# dfss 私有工具链归档（从 13.24 容器导出，体积大，不入库）
docker/toolchains/


# Model file
*.mlir
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
*.prototxt
*.profile
*.bmodel.json
*.bmodel

# VSCode settings
.vscode

# OSX dir files
.DS_Store
__MACOSX/

# web tools
node_modules/
yarn.lock
package-lock.json

__pycache__

# psophliteos 子工程的 build/ 是构建脚本与 DEBIAN 打包模板（源码），非产物，需入库
!source/psophliteos/build/
!source/psophliteos/build/**
# psophliteos frontend/build/ 是 vben 构建配置（源码），非产物，需入库（事故曾丢）
!source/psophliteos/frontend/build/
!source/psophliteos/frontend/build/**
# pssm 子工程的 build/ 是构建脚本（源码），非产物，需入库
!source/pssm/build/
!source/pssm/build/**
# pbmssm 子工程的 build/ 是构建脚本 + deb 模板 + SE7 deb 资源（源码），非产物，需入库
!source/pbmssm/build/
!source/pbmssm/build/**

# 构建产物（交叉编译二进制）
source/pssm/ssm-arm64
source/pssm/release/ssm
source/psophliteos/sophliteos-arm64
source/psophliteos/sophliteos-linux_*.tgz
# psewriter 在 src/ 下跑 `go build ./...`（BUILD.md 的验证步骤）会就地生成这个
# 12 MB 的 linux 可执行文件，与源码同名同目录。交付物在 output/psewriter/ 下，
# 这个只是本机编译残留，入库只会让验证步骤把工作树弄脏并随源码漂移。
source/psewriter/src/sewriter

# sophliteos deb 构建产物
source/psophliteos/build/tmp/
source/psophliteos/release_version.txt
source/psophliteos/dist/
source/psophliteos/sophliteos
source/psophliteos/sophliteos-linux_*.tgz
source/psophliteos/build/sophliteos/DEBIAN/md5sums
source/psophliteos/build/sophliteos/data/
source/psophliteos/build/sophliteos_*.deb
source/psophliteos/build/sophliteos/DEBIAN/control

# superpowers 开发文档（设计/计划/工作记录）不入库
docs/superpowers/
**/docs/superpowers/
.superpowers/

# pnpm 缓存
.pnpm-store/

